  "text": "COMMERCIAL COUNSELLOR AND AUSTRALIAN GOVERNMENT\nTRADE COMMISSIONER IN MALAYA\nCABLE ADDRESS:\n\"AUSTCOM\" SINGAPORE\nP. O. BOX 99\nSINGAPORE\nTELEPHONE: 33825\n6TH. FLOOR,\nCROSBY HOUSE\nROBINSON ROAD.\nSINGAPORE, 1.\n22nd June, 1955.\nC.H. McFadyen, Esq., C.B.E.,\nsecretary.\nDepartment of Shipping & Iransport,\nMelbourne.\nDear Charles,\nNews\ncomes slowly to us in Singapore but I\nwas most pleased\nto read in the New Year's Honours\nthat\none, Charles Hector McFadyen, had been appointed\nCommander of the British Empire and this brief and\nsomewhat hurried\nnoteis to convey to you my\ncongratulations.\nShould you ever be passing through this way\nI feel\nsure\nthat you and I could adequately celebrate\nthe award\nand, of course, the occasion.\nKind regards,\nYours sincerely,\nMela\n(C. A.\nAllen)\nNO RESPONSIBILITY IS ACCEPTED BY THIS OFFICE CONCERNING THE STANDING OF ANY FIRMS MENTIONED",
